<title>UK: UBS unit sets NZ$150 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>UBS unit sets NZ$150 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS AUSTRALIA LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  UBS</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$150 MLN    COUPON     8.0 PCT   MATURITY    06.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375 PCT SELL CONC  0.875 PCT PRAECIP     0.125 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	GUARANTOR RATED AAA/AAA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
